sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Need as The requirement
    participant Pick as Default pick
    participant Just as Justification
    Need->>Pick: durable relational data with transactions
    Pick-->>Just: Postgres — until a number forces something else
    Need->>Pick: a partitioned, replayable log
    Pick-->>Just: Kafka — ordering per partition, consumers at their own pace
    Need->>Pick: low-latency shared cache
    Pick-->>Just: Redis — and say how the invalidation works
    Need->>Pick: large immutable blobs
    Pick-->>Just: object storage plus a CDN, never the database
    Need->>Pick: search over text or geo
    Pick-->>Just: Elasticsearch, fed asynchronously from the source of truth
    Note over Pick,Just: know one box per role deeply — a confident default beats a survey
